    "overview": "4 hybrid model・5 workloadでPrefix Cache比TTFTを平均3.25倍高速化し、1秒TTFT SLO下のsustainable QPSを平均1.66倍にする。Full Recomputeとのtask quality gapは平均1.71 point。cold-only 32k promptのsegment parallelismでは1 worker 2.83sから8 worker 0.49sへ短縮し5.7倍。",
    "key_results": [
      {
        "metric": "平均TTFT",
        "value": "3.25倍高速化",
        "baseline": "Prefix Cache",
        "condition": "4 hybrid models × 5 workloads",
        "interpretation": "segment reuseをstrict prefix外へ広げ、linear/full両層の再計算を減らす。"
      },
      {
        "metric": "sustainable QPS",
        "value": "平均1.66倍",
        "baseline": "Prefix Cache",
        "condition": "TTFT SLO=1s",
        "interpretation": "Qwen3.5-122BではPrefix Cache比1.71倍、Full Recompute比3.65倍。"
      },
      {
        "metric": "cold-only TTFT",
        "value": "2.83s→0.49s（5.7倍）",
        "baseline": "single worker",
        "condition": "32k prompt、8 workers",
        "interpretation": "segment self-containmentでcache miss prefillをscale-outできる。"
      },
      {
        "metric": "quality gap",
        "value": "Full Recomputeから平均1.71 point",
        "baseline": "Full Recompute",
        "condition": "4 models / public tasks",
        "interpretation": "完全一致ではなく、少量boundary recomputeとのaccuracy-performance tradeoffが残る。"
      }
    ],
    "negative_results": "PICはFull Recomputeと数値完全一致ではなくquality gapを残す。transition tuple構築は初回missで追加計算を要し、segment parallelismはworker/NIC資源とcombine transferを必要とする。",
    "interpretation": "hybrid-attentionでPICを成立させる鍵はtoken KVを無理に保存することではなく、linear recurrenceをsegment-level algebraへ持ち上げること。cold missまでsegment parallelismへ広げた点がserving上の重要差分。",
    "quality_impact": "Full Recompute比平均1.71 pointの差。seam window幅で品質と再計算量を調整する近似方式。"
  }
}

